[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SSS008
TITLE: The port shall carry content and phrase text and shall not select an encoding
STATEMENT: >>>
The port between the aircraft and a peer shall carry the transmission fields and the rendered phrase. It shall also carry the events delivered, blocked, garbled, down, and up. It shall not select a radio, socket, line format, or other byte encoding. Acceptance is an in-memory delivery of one phrase that a peer can read, with no encoded frame around it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The encoding is an open decision recorded here so a later plan can choose it.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: System
VERIFICATION: Review
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
